OL,3,GNEWSAExtra ferry services put on ahead
OL,4,Aof strong winds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA ferry company is arranging extra
OL,7,Fservices between Jersey, France and the
OL,8,FUK ahead of expected strong winds.
OL,10,FDFDS confirmed some sailings had been
OL,11,Fcancelled and others were under review
OL,12,Fwhile it monitored weather conditions.
OL,14,FGusts could reach up to 65mph (104km/h)
OL,15,Fon Friday, according to Jersey Met.
OL,17,FChris Parker, route director for
OL,18,FJersey, said disruption to services was
OL,19,F"unavoidable" due to the forecast and
OL,20,Fsaid teams were doing "everything
OL,21,Fpossible to minimise the impact".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
